  <description>
    A standing person. Model created with Makehuman (http://www.makehuman.org/)
   Modified for oomwoo_gazebo: (1) added <static>true</static> - upstream ships it as a dynamic 80 kg body that topples in a furnished room; (2) textures downsampled to 1024 px, normal maps renormalised after resampling. Geometry and UVs unchanged.</description>
</model>
